      {
        "n": "R_R_ & Gintė Preisaitė",
        "s": "2026-11-12T14:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-12T15:00:00Z",
        "d": "Recorded during a week-long Baltic Rehearsals residency in Vilnius, this live session brings together RR and Gintė Preisaitė in an hour of entirely original, unreleased material. Developed collaboratively throughout the residency and presented as a live performance at its conclusion at the local space Retritro Smarsas, the recording captures a new body of work created specifically during their time together in Vilnius.\nBaltic Rehearsals is a residency project celebrating new music from Vilnius, Riga and Tallinn. Initiated by the Independent Community Radio Network (ICRN) with two of its member stations, Tīrkultūra and IDA, the project brings together four new artist duos. Their collaborations will be presented at Le Guess Who? 2026 as part of the COSMOS programme, with a compilation release to follow.\nSupported by Baltic Culture Fund.",
        "j": null,
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/guests/episodes/r_r_-ginte-presaite-12th-november-2026"
